elates_to","target_id":"df01-290f-89a2-4ce8"}],"description":"## Observed defect\nOn origin/main 2ca3e28fcc6, `pytest tests/unit/test_reclaim_resign.py -k test_resign_makes_enforced_verify_pass_with_era_keys` fails (reproduced locally on macOS and in Gerrit CI on ubuntu py3.11, py3.12 and py3.13, runs 44728882402 and 44728890345):\n\n```\ntests/unit/test_reclaim_resign.py:382\nassert {f[\"verdict\"] for f in failing} == {\"unsigned\", \"bad-signature\"}\nAssertionError: assert {'signer-not-...', 'unsigned'} == {'bad-signature', 'unsigned'}\n```\n\n## Cause (from history)\n- `9a6ed375112` \"Classify off-keyring signers apart from forgeries\" (starving-sphalerite-skua) changed `verify-identity` so a sound signature by a key that is not on the claimed author's keyring reports `signer-not-on-keyring` instead of `bad-signature`.\n- `717c50f8b33` \"Re-sign failing events during the reclaim collapse\" (minimum-seedy-lowchen) added this test expecting the old `bad-signature` verdict for the fixture's off-keyring events. The two landed independently, so main is red on this test.\n\n## Impact\nEvery Gerrit change whose CI runs the default pytest tier gets `Verified -1` until this is fixed (seen on 3472 and 3473).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `pytest tests/unit/test_reclaim_resign.py -q` passes on main, with the failing-verdict expectation matching the current verify-identity vocabulary (`signer-not-on-keyring` for a sound off-keyring signature) or the fixture producing a genuine forgery if `bad-signature` is what the test means to exercise.\n- [ ] `make verify` is green and the fix lands through Gerrit with LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/test_reclaim_resign.py","reason":"update stale bad-signature expectation to signer-not-on-keyring for the off-keyring fixture events"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","df01-290f-89a2-4ce8"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"25d8d618-11ae-485c-a55c-1dbb30d33c96","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"096f-a831-3aac-4851","ticket_type":"bug","title":"test_reclaim_resign expects bad-signature but verify-identity now reports signer-not-on-keyring (main is red)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a2cc4b54-2b8f-463d-8d7d-7a93c346738d","67cf80cb-97fc-441d-add6-2e482ca558c9","caca70d9-c4a1-4c2d-8873-f6c7d83f11e4","25d8d618-11ae-485c-a55c-1dbb30d33c96","a88ff3e1-9766-4026-aba0-8124a8fdd2e5","6039a8fa-5741-46f7-9ada-98faea5e93b1","d1619f7e-ea5f-4568-bbef-4a110cd05754","90579986-7fcc-4515-abab-4a6c8811707c"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795180119814180002,"uuid":"e54f3a0b-c039-4ce5-91f8-d0be1aa09f93"}
